    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nevrosa 2025\u00a0</strong>is a meticulously crafted VR puzzle/escape room game where players must solve numerous puzzles, battle mysterious creatures, and uncover a new Misty World hidden beyond the mirror in a grandfather's laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by the original creators of the Nevrosa series, this is an enhanced and expanded remake, designed to meet modern gaming standards and systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It offers an extended story from the original <i>Nevrosa: Escape</i> and <i>Prelude</i>, enriched with new puzzles, scenes, and animations \u2014 a game that represents the vision we always had for the Nevrosa series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nevrosa 2025\u00a0</strong>is a meticulously crafted VR puzzle/escape room game where players must solve numerous puzzles, battle mysterious creatures, and uncover a new Misty World hidden beyond the mirror in a grandfather's laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1cc60f3e1b5b354980bedc162eba7634.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by the original creators of the Nevrosa series, this is an enhanced and expanded remake, designed to meet modern gaming standards and systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/1e50d0fbc8dd7c9f2a9fe8cd36c0dc1a.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It offers an extended story from the original <i>Nevrosa: Escape</i> and <i>Prelude</i>, enriched with new puzzles, scenes, and animations \u2014 a game that represents the vision we always had for the Nevrosa series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.poster.avif?t=1752156881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.webm?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116390/extras/9e1ecf41c9081b31d995175a35f44079.mp4?t=1752156881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
